lities installed, maintained, and clean","repeat":false,"comment":"6-501.11: The lightbulb casing in the walk-in freezer is observed to have an accumulation of ice. This casing should be removed to monitor the issue and determine if there is water entering the fixture by a leak or if it condensation build-up inside the casing. The facility utilizes shatterproof bulbs and the casing may remain off the light fixture if the moisture is condensation related.\n6-501.11: PHYSICAL FACILITIES shall be maintained in good repair.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"432402","date":"2022-09-28","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8281&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=432402&INSPECTION_NN=432402","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"444256","date":"2022-03-07","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8281&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=444256&INSPECTION_NN=444256","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"410043","date":"2022-02-24","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":1,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8281&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=410043&INSPECTION_NN=410043","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":38,"title":"Insects, rodents, and animals not present","repeat":false,"comment":"6-501.111: There is an ant trail in the kitchen going to a sweet potato fry on the ground. There are bait traps in place int he kitchen. Facility is going to remove the fry, clean the area with bleach to get rid of the scent trail, and then will keep the bait traps in place until the issue is eradicated. More than likely, the construction taking place is causing the ants to migrate throughout the building. Maintenance is aware of the issue. PIC and inspector are going to communicate via text to confirm the issue has been eradicated.\n6-501.111: PREMISE shall be maintained free of insects, rodents, and other pests. If present (A) Routinely inspect shipments of FOOD and supplies (B) Inspect PREMISE routinely (C) Using methods, such as trapping devices Pf (D) Eliminate harborage conditions.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"398577","date":"2021-10-07","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8281&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=398577&INSPECTION_NN=398577","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"378985","date":"2021-02-10","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8281&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=378985&INSPECTION_NN=378985","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"376149","date":"2020-12-16","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8281&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=376149&INSPECTION_NN=376149","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"354606","date":"2020-01-24","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8281&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=354606&INSPECTION_NN=354606","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"332631","date":"2019-05-24","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Ori